{"title":"Titanium Kryss","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Kragg The Unmoved, Ogre Butcher, Warchief Ruk Gorehand, Thak Footman, Gutrot The Carver +9 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 40 · STR 100 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Dagger</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Archers</b> start with it. Everyone else can finish the quest <b><a href=\"#/guide/quest-the-mercy-knives\">The Mercy Knives</a></b> (Warden Maud Ferrow, level 11): free, and you keep the skill for good, or study a <b>Dagger tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-shieldbearer\" title=\"Thak Shieldbearer - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/e4f67001d17ee589aa8c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Shieldbearer</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"embalmed-priest\" title=\"Embalmed Priest - dropped it in 1 of 6 looted corpses (1/6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/93110eebbbe23ef1adb0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Embalmed Priest</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 5 of 84 looted corpses (1/17)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 4 of 85 looted corpses (1/21)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/21<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+10 more\">+10 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-carver\" title=\"Gutrot The Carver - dropped it in 3 of 85 looted corpses (1/28)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1f884f2242ac6c9d138c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gutrot The Carver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/28<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 3 of 85 looted corpses (1/28)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/28<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mountain\" title=\"Mountain Ogre - dropped it in 3 of 428 looted corpses (1/143)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe10b0281fa1b1c70ebf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mountain Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/143<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 5 of 864 looted corpses (1/173)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/173<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 2 of 523 looted corpses (1/262)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/262<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-elder\" title=\"Ogre Elder - dropped it in 2 of 771 looted corpses (1/386)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Elder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/386<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 3 of 1,185 looted corpses (1/395)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/395<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - dropped it in 2 of 834 looted corpses (1/417)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f9a97fb7ded29e1c31d3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/417<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - dropped it in 1 of 495 looted corpses (1/495)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/495<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 1,439 looted corpses (1/1,439)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,439<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"titanium-kryss\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss?q=crude\">Crude <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>15</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss?q=good\">Good <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss?q=superior\">Superior <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss?q=flawless\">Flawless <span>1</span></a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"titanium-kryss\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-