/td><td><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span> 2 · <span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span> 2</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest\">Embalmed Priest</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span> 1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"titanium-kryss\" data-map-quality=\"excellent\">Show where it drops Excellent on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-kryss\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/ff06530d73c8d6890e24.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Kryss</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Kryss</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/f34cb12d01760f5e9019.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Kryss</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic q-glow-excellent\"><img src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"Titanium Kryss\"><span id=\"gearEnchBadge\" class=\"wp-badge\"></span></div><h3>Titanium Kryss <span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">(Excellent)</span></h3><table>\n      \n      <tr><th>Damage</th><td id=\"gearDmg\">12.8–32 damage <span class=\"muted\">(Excellent)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Requires</th><td>Lvl 40 · STR 100</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>14 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/28/2026, 9:43:26 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}